# Independent verification of PR #469 (perf/strided-rect) + PR #470 (verify/rect-soundness-gates)

Verifier round, 2026-08-09. Nothing in this file is quoted from either PR: every
number was produced by this worktree on this box, and the two places where I
DID reuse a committed artefact are named as such.

- Host: Apple M4 Pro (12 cores: 8P + 4E), macOS, aarch64. Idle box.
- Base: `main` @ ee07b00. Head: `perf/strided-rect` @ 4db4144 (+ #470's
  test-only commit 2a246aa for the crate-test rows).
- Branch point check: `git merge-base perf/strided-rect main` == ee07b00 ==
  `main@origin` HEAD. The branch is NOT stale; the effect cannot be an artefact
  of a mechanism removed since.
- Binaries: `bench_ab_decode` built `--release` from each tree, staged as
  `bench_base` / `bench_head`.
  sha256 base 104bd2fda508d531b0434c77581208f6ef600dc0da1e96aed2d42904b37aaec1
  sha256 head 6baaad6b6445816e6392b3079c5fb827681a252dbe943679eaa89299c6dca43c
- Raw: `rectverify_gap_2026-08-09.tsv` (168 rows, `foreign_max = 0` on ALL of
  them; 3 cells were discarded by the idle gate and re-run).

