Scaling t1->t8: 8bpc base **4.83x** -> head **6.37x** (dav1d_fd1 7.16x);
10bpc 5.20x -> 6.27x (7.03x).

**The perf claim reproduces.** #469 reports head/base 1.014 / 0.843 / 0.812 /
0.785 at 8bpc; I measure 1.018 / 0.839 / 0.821 / 0.773. Its head/ref column
(1.309 / 1.332 / 1.323 / 1.477) lands within 0.01 of mine at every cell. Its
t=1 OVERLAP verdict reproduces at n=7.

One correction: **base at 8bpc t=1 is 1.283 here, not the 1.291 #469's table
carries** — main's best cell is already UNDER the ~1.30 bar, and this change
moves it to 1.306, i.e. back over. #469 states the direction; the base column
is 0.008 optimistic against my sweep.

